# OpenThinRDP Manager: English texts (the reference: every key used by the manager must be here).
# Values with {0}, {1}... are .NET format strings (-f): keep the placeholders when translating.
# A key missing from another language file falls back to the text in this one.
# Translators: copy this file to <two letters>.psd1 and save it as UTF-8 WITH BOM (Windows PowerShell 5.1
# reads files without BOM as ANSI). Never translate setting keys (BROKER...), values (tcp, on, off...) or
# file names (common.conf...): the devices read them as they are.
